{
  "name": "Rendley — Product Photo to Video Ad",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Product Photo → Video Ad\n\nPOST a product image URL and an optional creative prompt. Rendley animates the still into a short video ad with `generate-video` (image-to-video), the node resolves the result to a fresh URL, and the flow copies the MP4 to your storage.\n\n**Send:** `POST /webhook/product-video-ad` with `{ \"image_url\": \"https://…/shoe.jpg\", \"prompt\": \"slow orbit, studio light, premium feel\" }`.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Credits\nVideo generation is one of the heavier AI actions: needs a **paid Rendley plan** and consumes **credits** — commonly **~100–300 credits** per clip depending on model, resolution and duration. Toggle *Estimate Cost Only* (hits `/cost`) for an exact quote first.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Plan and cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Polled inline\nThe node waits for the generation with **Wait for Completion**, which keeps the flow one linear chain. Keep the **Poll Interval** at 10 s or more: generation can take a couple of minutes.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Why inline",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        660
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Links expire — copy the file!\nThe generated clip is a **presigned media URL that expires after ~3 hours** (exports expire after ~4h). This flow downloads it and re-uploads to your own Google Drive so the ad is safe to reuse later.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        660
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "product-video-ad",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Incoming Product Photo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        440
      ],
      "webhookId": "product-video-ad-in"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "project",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "={{ 'Product Ad ' + $now.format('yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm') }}"
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Create Project",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        440
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "generate",
        "projectId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "aiPrompt": "={{ $('Incoming Product Photo').item.json.body.prompt || 'Cinematic product hero shot, smooth camera move, soft studio lighting, premium look' }}",
        "aiOptions": {
          "aspect_ratio": "9:16",
          "duration": 5,
          "start_image": "={{ $('Incoming Product Photo').item.json.body.image_url }}"
        },
        "estimateCostOnly": false,
        "waitForCompletion": true,
        "pollInterval": 10
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Rendley — Generate Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        440
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.download_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Download Ad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "name": "={{ 'product-ad-' + $now.format('yyyyLLdd-HHmmss') + '.mp4' }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ff000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Save to Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        820,
        440
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Incoming Product Photo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Project",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Project": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Rendley — Generate Video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Rendley — Generate Video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Ad",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download Ad": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save to Google Drive",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
